0..43 Comment "//! This fixture defines a Tarski universe."
44..47 Comment "//!"
48..126 Comment "//! Martin-Löf closes his universe under dependent functions, dependent pairs"
127..204 Comment "//! and identity types. This universe contains pair, dependent-pair, and path"
205..215 Comment "//! codes."
216..219 Comment "//!"
220..300 Comment "//! Each decoder returns the type named by its code. A decode stands in place as"
301..350 Comment "//! a call. The call is the type that it returns."
351..354 Comment "//!"
355..411 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
412..415 Comment "//!"
